			"notes": "## Changes\n- Velocity no longer gets applied to leashed mobs in 1.21.6+\n  - This is due to mobs falling down and rubber banding whenever they are meant to be stationary\n  - Resolves [#2](https://codeberg.org/BlueStaggo/anti-smooth/issues/2), though admittedly the solution isn't very glamorous\n- Added minecarts to the default list of unaffected entities\n\n## Fixes\n- Fixed mobs clipping through walls by shrinking their hitboxes client-side during solid collision detection (Resolves [#1](https://codeberg.org/BlueStaggo/anti-smooth/issues/1))"
